  <component name="VcsManagerConfiguration">
    <MESSAGE value="Initial commit" />
    <MESSAGE value="refactor: upgrade Recommendation Engine from static scoring to Style Space geometry&#10;&#10;Moved away from hard-coded compatibility scores (0.65/0.35) in favor of a &#10;Representational Learning approach. The model now maps outfits into a &#10;hypersphere where distance equals &quot;clash.&quot; Added a feedback loop that &#10;shifts a user's profile vector based on likes/dislikes, enabling &#10;true personalization." />
    <MESSAGE value="Fixed dataset generation script" />
    <MESSAGE value="Fixed color_utils.py bug for images containing less than 3 dominant colors" />
    <MESSAGE value="trained the stylist model" />
    <MESSAGE value="Switch the detection model from RF-DETR to the backup yolo model, created plant UML files on the project pipeline, updated the main pipeline to work with the yolo model" />
    <MESSAGE value="Included .safetensors in lfs filter" />
    <MESSAGE value="Created a new CI pipeline" />
    <MESSAGE value="Updated paths accordingly for the `models` directory structure." />
    <MESSAGE value="Reorganized models placements to one unified /models directory" />
    <MESSAGE value="Implemented containerized RAG backend with Airflow and Qdrant&#10;&#10;- Dockerized the entire MLOps infrastructure with strict separation of concerns between the online serving stack and offline orchestration stack.&#10;- Built asynchronous FastAPI gateway (`main.py`) to handle live inference, image perception, and reinforcement learning feedback.&#10;- Integrated Qdrant Vector Database to replace static PyTorch memory files, enabling hardware-accelerated 512-dim ANN semantic search.&#10;- Orchestrated Apache Airflow (`docker-compose-airflow.yml`) for batch data ingestion, feature extraction, and continuous model retraining.&#10;- Added `scripts/` directory containing production data ingestion and Qdrant seeding logic.&#10;- Implemented mocked CI/CD Pytest pipeline for headless GitHub Actions validation." />
    <MESSAGE value="Updates on `Prototyping.ipynb` and `Main_pipeline.ipynb` to the test the inference and model loading functions" />
